{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000403","bookName":"El capitán de ocho años: Rumbo al cielo (Doblado)","cover":"","viewCount":22868082,"followCount":477110,"introduction":"Daniel, piloto as, renacido a los ocho años en el momento en que volaba con su padre. Sabe que tras el despegue de este vuelo, todos a su alrededor morirán en un accidente aéreo. A nueve mil metros de altura, las llamas envuelven las alas, la cabina se rompe; todos están al borde de la muerte. En ese instante, debe, con el cuerpo de un niño de ocho años, evitar la caída del avión, salvar a su padre, que falleció protegiéndolo, y a cientos de pasajeros a bordo. ","chapterCount":58,"labels":["Pilot","Rebirth"],"tags":["Pilot","Rebirth"],"typeTwoIds":[303],"typeTwoNames":["Urbano"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":303,"name":"Urbano","replaceName":"urbano"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Urbano","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"El-capitán-de-ocho-años-Rumbo-al-cielo-Doblado","bookNameLower":"el-capitán-de-ocho-años-rumbo-al-cielo-doblado","shelfTime":"2025-11-14 13:44:22","firstShelfTime":"2025-11-14 13:44:22","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700025117","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":213205,"price":0},{"id":"700025118","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":116145,"price":0},{"id":"700025119","index":2,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":97476,"price":0},{"id":"700025120","index":3,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":109017,"price":0},{"id":"700025121","index":4,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":77624,"price":0},{"id":"700025122","index":5,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":100704,"price":0},{"id":"700025123","index":6,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":73630,"price":0},{"id":"700025124","index":7,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":93320,"price":0},{"id":"700025125","index":8,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":65038,"price":0},{"id":"700025126","index":9,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","